<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">1PET 61 Soli Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">1 PETULO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya kutanguna ya Petulo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petulo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Petulo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kalata ya kutanguna ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petulo</para>
  <para style="imt">Busansulushi</para>
  <para style="ip">Libuku lya 1 Petulo ni Kalata yalalembewa ne mutumwa Petulo. Walatatika kulemba kalata iyi pakulisansulula mwine. Walalembela kalata iyi ku baklistu bonse “bensu pacishi ca panshi” 1 Petulo 1:1 Petulo walikubambila beshikubelenga kalata iyi munshila yamushoboyu tunkanda twingi. Pacebo cakwambeti, kalata ya Petulo yakoshanako ne kalata ya mutumwa Paulo njalalembela ku Baefeso munshila shingi, bantu bangi bashometi kalata ya 1 Petulo yalalembewa panyuma pa kalata ya Paulo kuli Baefeso mucaka ca 65 A.D. Petulo walalemba kalata iyi kali ku Loma uko nkwalambeti ni ku Babiloni 5:13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Petulo lambangeti, lalembele kalata iyi pacebo ca kumuyuminisha ne kwinshila bukamboni pacebo ca luse ne cancinencine ca Lesa 5:12 Pali kukoshana kwingi pali mabala ali pa 1 Petulo 2:11 mpaka 3:7, ne Baefeso 5:18 mpaka 6:9, kayi ne Bakolose 3:18 mpaka 4:6. Byonse bibela bitatu ibi, bilapanga malailile abwikalo bwelela beshikamukowa ne banse, kayi ne shakunyumfwila batangunishi bonse. Kayi Petulo layuminishinga baklistu kwambeti, bakakatilengowa mu lushomo nambi pacindi ncobalapitinga mumapensho pakwinga cindi camapwililisho cilipepi 4:1</para>
  <para style="iot">Mitwi ya makani</para>
  <para style="io1">Petulo lalisansulunga ne kwambila beshi kubala bakendi 1:1-2.</para>
  <para style="io1">Kayi lalumbunga Lesa pacebo cakupulushiwa uko nkobakute bonse ne ncecila pandululunga ici mubuyumi bwetu 1:3 mpaka 2:10</para>
  <para style="io1">Kukonkapo, labambilinga mwakwikalila cena pacishi kayi ne bwikalo bwelela mumanda, mulume ne mukashendi kayi ne musha ne shikumulela 2:11 mpaka 4:11</para>
  <para style="io1">Panyuma, Petulo labayuminishinga pacebo cakukakatilowa nambi pacindi camapensho 4:12 mpaka 5:11</para>
  <para style="io1">Lapwishinga kalata ya kendi 5:12-14</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Njame Petulo, musebenshi wa Yesu Klistu. Ndalembenga iyi kalata kuli njamwe mwasalwa ne Lesa mulekalangeti bensu mubimpansha byaku Ponto, ne ku Galatiya, neku Kapadokiya, neku Asiya kayi neku Bituniya. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Kwelana ne kuyanda kwa Lesa Bata kwesula kufuminowa kumatatikilo mwalasalwa kayi mwalaswepeshewa ne Mushimu Uswepa kwambeti mube beshikunyumfwila Yesu Klistu, mwalasukwa ne milopa yakendi. Lesa amunyumfwile nkumbo ne kumupa lumuno lwesula.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupembelela kwancinencine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tulumbe Lesa Baishi Mwami wetu Yesu Klistu. Pakwinga mukufula kwa nkumbo shakendi, walatupa buyumi bwa linolino pakumupundusha Yesu Klistu kubafu. Neco tukute lushomo lwayuma nta, <verse number="4" style="v"/>lwakwambeti nitukatambule colwe cabintu byaina Lesa mbyabambila bantu bakendi kwilu, uko nkweshi bikabule kubola, nambi kwipishiwa, nambi kushimangana. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ibi bintu nibyenu, kupitila mulushomo, byabambwa cena mungofu sha Lesa kwambeti mukatambule lupulusho ulo lulipepi kuboneka pacindi camapwililisho. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ibi kabimukondweleshani nambi pacino cindi mucane mapensho ne kwelekeshewa kwapusanapusana. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ibi ni bishikubonesheti lushomo lwenu ni lwancinencine. Nambi golide ukute konongeka ukute kwengeka nemulilo, nalo lushomo lwenu ulo lwapita golide, lwela kwelekeshewa kwambeti lucanike kuba lwancinencine. Mwenseco nimukatambule kulumbwa, ne bulemu pabusuba mbweshakayubuluke Yesu Klistu. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Nambi ntamuna mumubonapo, nsombi mumusuni. Nambi pacindi cino nkamulamubononga mwamushoma, kayi mwakondwa citambiki.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Pakwinseco mulatambulunga cilambo ca lushomo, uku ekwambeti lupulusho lwenu. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Bashinshimi balambapo sha cilambo calupulusho ndweshimukatambule, balo balalangaula mwabuya lupulusho ulu, Lesa ndwetamupe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mushimu wa Klistu walikuba mulyendibo walikwambila limo sha byeshikubaba Klistu mbyeshakanyumfwe, kayi ne bulemu mbweshakabe nabo panyuma pakendi. Bashinshimi balikuyanda kwishiba cindi kayi ne moti bikenshikilenga. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lesa walabayubulwila kwambeti ncito njobalikwinsa nkayalikuba yakuyanda bene, nsombi balikwinshilamwe, mpobalikwamba bintu ibyo mbyemulanyumfunga kuli batumwa bakendi balakambaukunga Mulumbe Waina kupitila mu Mushimu Uswepa walafuma kwilu. Ibi ebintu nabo bangelo mbyebalikuyanda kwishiba.</para>
  <para style="s">Labasengengeti babe baswepa myoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Eco cakendi myoyo yenu ibe yalibambila. Kamubani babangamana. Bikani lushomo lwenu lonse pa colwe nceshi mukapewe Yesu Klistu akayubuluka. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nyumfwilani Lesa, kamutaleka buyumi bwenu kubumbwa nelunkumbwa ndomwalikukute kamutana mwishiba Klistu. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Mbuli Lesa ncali waswepa uyo walamukuwa, nenjamwe kamubani baswepa mumikalilo yenu yonse. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mabala alambangeti, “Kamubani baswepa myoyo mbuli Ame ncendaswepa moyo.” <verse number="17" style="v"/>Lesa liya lusalululo. Ukute kombolosha uliyense kwelana ne micito yakendi. Mwambangeti, Ta pakupaila, mupeni bulemu cindi conse ncomulicili panshi pano. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mucishi cena ncalasebenshesha pakumulubula ku mikalilo yaipa njemwalatambula kufumina ku bamashali benu. Liya kumulubula ne mali asa akute konongeka, silifa nambi golide sobwe. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Walamulubula ne milopa ya Klistu yamulo wadula, uyo walalibengeti M wanambelele wabula cibala nambi bulema. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Lesa walamusalilalimo cishi capanshi citana cilengwa, nomba lamuyubululu mumasuba ano akupwililisha cebo canjamwe. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kupitila mulyendiye, mulashomonga Lesa walamupundusha kubafu, nekumupa bulemu. Neco lushomo ne kupembelela kwenu bili pali Lesa. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Mulaswepeshe myoyo yenu pakunyumfwa cancinencine, kwambeti munyumfwanenga ne baklistu banenu. Ecebo cakendi mwela kusunana nemoyo wonse. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Pakwinga mulenshi kusemwa tubili,buyumi bwakendi nkabulafumunga mu mbuto ya mushali ukute kufwa sobwe, nsombi mu mbuto itafu, iyo mbuto ni maswi a Lesa, maswi abuyumi eshakabule kupwa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Mbuli Mabala a Lesa, alambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Bantu bonse balyeti mila,</para>
  <para style="q">bulemu bwabo bulyeti maluba amucisuwa.</para>
  <para style="q">Mila ikute kuyuma, nawo maluba akute kunyana. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nsombi maswi a Lesa nakabeko cindi conse.” Uwu e Mulumbe Waina walakambaukwa kulinjamwe.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Libwe lyabuyumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi tayani byaipa byonse, kubepa, kulibonesha, ne munyono kayi ne minyansho. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mbuli mwana lasemwa calinolino ncakute kulilila mukupa wabanyina, nenjamwe kamubanga ne nkunukwa ya mukupa wancinencine wakumushimu, kwambeti umukulishe nekumushikisha kukupuluka. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mbuli Mabala ncalambangeti, “Mulatelele nkumbo sha Mwami.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Lino kamwisani kuli Mwami, libwe lyabuyumi ndyobalakana bantu, nsombi Lesa walalisala kuba lya mulo wadula. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kamwisani mube mabwe abuyumi ngoti asebenseshe Lesa kwibaka ng'anda yakendi, umo mweti musebenselengeti beshimilumbo baswepa balatwalanga milumbo njalayandanga Lesa kupitila muli Yesu Klistu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Pakwinga mu Mabala mwalembweti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Ndasala libwe lya mulo wadula.</para>
  <para style="q">Ndalibiki kuba libwe lyankokola yang'anda mu Siyoni.</para>
  <para style="q">Waushoma nteti akanyufwe nsoni.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino kuli omwashoma, nendi ni wamulo wadula. Nomba kuli babula lushomo, maswi a Lesa alambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Libwe beshikwibaka ng'anda ndyobalakana,</para>
  <para style="q">elyalasanduka kuba libwe lyankokola yang'anda.” <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kayi maswi a Lesa alambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Lyopeleli e libwe lyeti bakalipuntengaponga bantu, libwe lyacandanshi, lyeti likabawishenga bantu.” Ee balalipuntunga pakwinga balakananga maswi a Lesa, kayi ici ecalikuyandika kulyendibo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nomba njamwe mukowa wasalwa, beshimilumbo bacami, mushobo waswepa, bantu bakendi Lesa. Walamusala kwambeti mukakambauke ncito sha ngofu sha uyo walamukuweti mufume mumushinshe kuya kwingila mukumunika kwakendi kwakankamanisha. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kaindi nkamwalikuba bantu bakendi Lesa, nsombi lino njamwe bakendi. Kaindi nkamwalikwishiba sha Lesa, nomba lino mulatambulu nkumbo shakendi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Mobanse bame, pakwinga njamwe bensu mucishici, ndamusengenga kamutakonkelanga lunkumbwa lwa mibili lukute kulwana nkondo ne buyumi bwenu bwa kumushimu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Cendo cenu pakati pa bantu ba kunsa cibe caina, kwambeti nambi balamwambangeti mobeshi kwinsa byaipa, nsombi babona ncito shenu shaina, bakakonshe kulemekesha Lesa pabusuba mbweshakese.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Cebo ca Mwami Lesa, nyumfwilani bamakulene bakute ngofu shabwendeleshi. Mbuli usa Mwami mukulene ukute ngofu shinene shabwendeleshi munyumfwileni, pakwinga ukute bwendeleshi pa bami nabambi bonse, <verse number="14" style="v"/>na nibendeleshi mbwalasala, naboyo banyumfwileni pakwinga walabatuma kwambeti bapenga cisubulo beshikwinsa byaipa, kayi kulumba abo balenshinga byaina. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Pakwinga Lesa layandangeti mupwishe kwamba kwabuluya kwa bantu kupitila mu bintu byaina mbyomulenshinga. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ee, kamubani basunguluka, nsombi kusunguluka kwenu kakutabanga kwakufwekelela byaipa, nsombi kamwikalani eti basebenshi ba Lesa. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kamulemekanga bantu bonse. Sunani baklistu banenu. Tinani Lesa, kayi neye mwami mukulene usa mumupe bulemu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Amwe basebenshi, nyumfwilani nekupa bulemu abo bamwingisha ncito, nteko kuli baina moyo bonka sobwe, nsombi nekuli balukanda bonse. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ni cintu caina ulimbikilowa mubyeshikubaba byabula kumwelela pakwinga Lesa nakamupe colwe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Niciyani ncondelela kumulumba na balamumunga cebo ca mulandu ngomwensa? Nsombi na mulimbikilowa cebo cakwinsa byaina,ekwambeti mulenshi cintu casuminishiwa ne Lesa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Bwikalo bulicisa embwalamukuwila Lesa, ntepasa neye Klistu walanyumfwa byeshikubaba cebo canjamwe, nekumushiyila cilesho kwambeti mukonkelenga myendo yakendi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Liya kwinsapo bwipishi bulibonse, kayi liya kwambapo byabwepeshi sobwe. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Mpobalikumutukana liya kubweshela matuka. Mpwalikupenshewa liya kubayoshapo, nsombi byonse walabibika mumakasa a Lesa, momboloshi walulama. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Klistu walalitwika bwipishi bwetu bonse mumubili wakendi palusanda, kwambeti tuleke kwipisha mubuyumi bwetu, nomba pakukonkela bululami tube bayumi. Mwalasengulwa ne mibata yakendi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Mwalikubeti mbelele shataika, nomba lino mulabwelele kuli mwembeshi lamwembelenga ne kumulanga cena.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Bakashi ne balume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Munshila ilico, nenjamwe batukashi mwebwa, bombelani bamulume benu, kwambeti nabambi batanyumfu maswi a Lesa, nibalitibuke bene nekushoma, babona mikalilo yenu yaina. Nteti pakayandike maswi akwambapo sobwe, <verse number="2" style="v"/>pakwinga nibakalibonene bene mikalilo yenu yabulemu kayi yaswepa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kwapa kwenu kakutabowa kwakunsa, kwakuposa mishishi kwanyanyisha, nekuli kobaika byagolide, byamulo wadula. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Amwe kwapa kwenu kube ncomubele mukati, kwapa kutapu kwa moyo wabomba kayi wakamweneneshi. Moyo ulico eulayandikinga pamenso pali Lesa. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Umu batukashi bakaindi baswepa myoyo, kayi bashoma Lesa mobalikulyapisha, kayi balikunyumfwila balume babo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Encalikuba Sala,walikumunyumfwila Abulahamu, nekumukuweti, “Nkambo.” Neco amwe batukashi njamwe banabendi Sala, na kamwinsa cena mwakubula kutina kantu kalikonse.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nenjamwe balume, kamwikalanga cena ne bamakashenu nekubeshibeti nimushobo wabula ngofu. Bapeni bulemu pakwinga nimukatambule pamo cipo ca Lesa cabuyumi. Kamwinsangeco kwambeti pabule kuba kantu kela kushinkilisha mipailo yenu.</para>
  <para style="s">Kunyumfwa bishikubaba cebo cabululami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Maswi akupwililisha nakwambeti, mwense mube ne moyo umo kayi munyumfwilanenga nkumbo. Sunanani eti pabukwenu. Kamubani ne moyo wankumbo kayi balicepesha. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Balamwinshilinga byaipa kamutababweshela byaipa, balamutukananga, kamutabatukananga. Amwe mubapenga colwe, pakwinga amwe Lesa walamukuwani kubwikalo bulico kwambeti mukatambule colwe cakendi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ntepasa Maswi a Lesa alambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">Layandanga kusamwa ne buyumi,</para>
  <para style="q">ne kubona masuba aina,</para>
  <para style="q">alekeshe lulemi lwakendi kwamba byaipa,</para>
  <para style="q">kayi mulomo wakendi uleke bwepeshi,</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Aleye byaipa neye ainse byaina,</para>
  <para style="q">alangaule lumuno ne moyo wakendi wonse.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ntepasa Mwami ukute kubalanga cena bantu balulama,</para>
  <para style="q">ukute kushako matwi kumipailo yabo.</para>
  <para style="q">Nomba beshikwinsa byaipa ukute kubapa camusana.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Niyani wela kumwinshila byaipa na kamukute kangwabu pa bintu byaina? <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nomba nambi munyumfwe bishikubaba cebo ca bululami kondwani, kamutatina bantu nambi kupenga mumoyo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nomba amwe lemekeshani Klistu Mwami wenu mumyoyo yenu. Kamubani balibambila cindi conse. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kamubani nemoyo wabula kankoleleshi kwambeti bantu nabambi bakumbwileko cendo cenu caina omulakonkelenga Klistu. kwambeti mubanyufwishe nsoni balamutukananga. Kamubani balibambia kubakumbula mwakubomba moyo, kayi mubulemu, bantu balamwipushunga shakupembelela nkomukute. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Caina kunyumfwa byeshikubaba cebo cakwinsa byaina na encalayandanga Lesa, kupita kunyumfwa byeshikubaba cebo ca kwinsa byaipa. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Klistu walafwila bwipishi bwa bantu kankanda kamo, muntu walulama kutufwila kwambeti atushikishe kuli Lesa. Ee kumubili walafwa, nsombi Mushimu wa Lesa walamupundusha. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kacili mu Mushimu walaya kukambauka ku mishimu yasungwa mujele. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Iyi mishimu ni yabantu bakaindi balabula kunyumfwa Lesa mpwalikupembelela camoyonteka, pacindi Nowa mpwalikwibaka bwato umo mobalapulukila bantu basanu ne batatu. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Asa menshi ecikoshano ca lubatisho lulamupulushunga masuba ano, ulu lubatisho nkalukute kuswepesha mubili sobwe, nsombi nikulibenga nemoyo wonse kuli Lesa, elupulusho lwenu pacebo cakupunduka kwa Klistu. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Klistuyo walaya Kwilu kayi wekala ku cikasa calulyo ca Lesa. Kopeloko bangelo, ne bendeleshi ne ngofu bonse bakute kumunyumfwila.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Buyumi bwalinolino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Lino pakwinga Klistu walanyumfwa byeshikubaba, nenjamwe kamuliyuminishani ne miyeyo ilico, pakwinga uliyense lanyumfunga byeshikubaba lalekana ne bwipishi. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Neco pacindi ncoti mwikale panshi pano, konkelani kuyanda kwa Lesa, muleke kukonkela lunkumbwa lwa bantu. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mwalikutayowa cindi kwinsa bintu mbyebasuni bakunsa. Mwalikwinsa bintu byasafwana, lunkumbwa lwaipa, ne kukolewa, nebukuma ne kulondola pakunwa kayi ne kukambilila tumbwanga kwasesemya. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nomba lino bantu bakunsa balakankamananga pakuboneti mulaleke kwinshila pamo byaipa mbyebalenshika mwakutalikanisha, ecebo cakendi lino balamutukananga. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nomba nibakayandiketi balyambilile bene mulandu wabo kuli Lesa uyo walibambila kombolosha bayumi ne bafwa. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi Mulumbe Waina walakambaukwa kubafu, kuli bantu balomboloshewa kabacili mumubili, nsombi mumushimu babe nebuyumi eti Lesa.</para>
  <para style="s">Kwikatisha ncito bipo bya Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Lino, mapwililisho a bintu byonse alaba pepi. Kamubani bacetuka kayi beshikulikanisha, kwambeti mucikonshe kupaila. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Cilayandikinga nicakwambeti kamusunana, pakwinga lusuno lukute kufukila bwipishi bwingi. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Mufwakashilanenga mwakubula kutongauka. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Cipo uliyense ncalatambula kuli Lesa, acisebenseshe ku munendi. Mubeti mukulene wa ncito lasebenseshenga bipo byapusana pusana mbyalatambula kuli Lesa. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Uliyense akambaukanga, akambauke maswi a Lesa. Uliyense lasebensenga, asebense mwangofu nshalapewa ne Lesa, kwambeti mubintu byonse, bulemu bupewe kuli Lesa kupitila muli Yesu Klistu. Bulemu ne ngofu nibyakendi cindi conse. Amen.</para>
  <para style="s">Kupenshewa cebo cakuba mklistu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mobansebame, kamutakankamana ne mapensho ngomulelekeshewanga, kamutayeyeti alanyanyishi sobwe. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nomba kamukondwani mwanyumfwanga byeshikubaba pamo ne Klistu, kwambeti akesa mubulemu mukakondwe. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Bantu bamutukana cebo ca lina lya Klistu mukute colwe pakwinga e Mushimu wabulemu, Mushimu wa Lesa ngwalabiki palinjamwe. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kapataba naba umo pakati penu eshacanike mumapensho pacebo cakushina muntu, nambi cebo ca kwiba, nambi cebo cakwinsa cintu caipa ciliconse, kayi nambi shikwingila mumakani abantu bambi. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Nomba na mulanyumfunga byeshikubaba pacebo cakuba baklistu, kamutanyumfwa nsoni sobwe, lemekeshani Lesa cebo ca lina lya Klistu. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Cindi cilaba pepi kwambeti Lesa atatike kombolosha bantu bakendi, lino na lombolosho lutatikila pali njafwe, inga nikukabeconi ku bantu batanyumfu Mulumbe Waina ulafumunga kuli Lesa? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Mbuli Mabala ncalambangeti, “Na bantu balulama nibakapuluke mwakupenga, inga nicikabeconi kuli bantu baipa beshikunyansha Lesa?” <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi abo balanyumfunga byeshikubaba cebo cakwambeti encalayandanga Lesa, balitwale mumakasa a Lesa wabo washomwa ukute kusunga cipangano cakendi.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Mubungano wa Lesa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ame ndemukulene munabo, nkute maswi akwamba kubamakulene bamubungano bali pakati penu. Njame kamboni wa mapensho a Klistu, kayi ndapembelelenga kutambula bulemu pamo nendibo ubo bweti bukaboneke. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Maswi akame nakwambeti, kamwembelani cena mbelele sha Lesa nshabikisha mumakasa enu. Shembeleni mwakuyandishisha, nteko kwinsa kumukakatisha sobwe nambi kuyandapo kantu nakambi, nsombi mwakuyanda mobene, mbuli Lesa ncalayandanga. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kamutabeti bami palyendibo sobwe, kamubani cilesho caina ku mbelele. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kayi mwembeshi mukulene akaboneka nimukatambule cilambo ca munshini wabulemu butapu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nenjamwe misepela, kamunyumfwilani bamakulene. Kayi mwense bani balibambila kunyamfwana umo ne munendi mwakulicepesha. Ntepasa maswi a Lesa alambangeti,</para>
  <para style="q">“Lesa ukute kubakana beshikulitunta,</para>
  <para style="q">neye ukute kwinshila nkumbo balicepesha.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ecebo cakendi kamulicepeshani pamenso a Lesa wangofu, kwambeti pacindi cakendi akamusumpule. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mutwikeni byonse bilamushupunga, pakwinga neye nakamusamalile cena. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kamucetukani, bangamanani. Mupelani wenu Satana lendananga uku ne uku eti nkalamu ilabulumunga, kulangaula ngweshalye. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kamutingana nendi kamulimwashimpa cena mulushomo, pakwishibeti baklistu banenu pacishi conse capanshi naboyo balanyumfunga byeshikubaba byamushobo umoumo. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Panyuma pa kunyumfwa byeshikubaba kwakacindi kang'ana, Lesa wankumbo shonse, lamukunga kwisakuyabana nendi mubulemu butapu pamo ne Klistu nakamubambe nekumuyuminisha, nekumwikalika mwakutatenkana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Neye eukute ngofu kwacindi conse. Amen.</para>
  <para style="s">Maswi akupwililisha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Lanyamfwilishi kulemba kalata ifupi iyi, ni Sailasi, mwanse washomeka. Ndayandanga kumulimbikisha nekumupa bukamboni bwakwambeti, uku ekwina moyo kwa Lesa. Cebo ca kwina moyoku, limbikilani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Banse benu ku mubungangano wabantu basalwa baku Babulo balamupanga mitende. Neye mwaname Maliko lamupanga mitende. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Panani mitende yalusuno lwaciklistu. Lumuno lube nenjamwe mwense, mobakendi Klistu.</para>
</usx>
